{"id":"na","lemma":"na","pos":"intj","rank":108,"glosses":["well!, so!; used to introduce a statement","oh, hm, huh, och, nu; expressing a (usually mild) degree of surprise, doubt, or frustration","huh?; used as a question marker, often implying that the speaker knows the answer"],"ipa":"/na(ː)/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7e/De-na2.ogg/De-na2.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Na gut, auf geht’s.","en":"Well, let's go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44625","words":[null,{"g":"good"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"S"}]},{"text":"Na, und du?","en":"How about you?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/564314","words":[null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"you"}]},{"text":"Na gut, wo fange ich an?","en":"Well, where do I start?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/760145","words":[null,{"g":"good"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"to catch","l":"fangen"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"at / on"}]},{"text":"Na los, ihr zwei!","en":"Come on, you two.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/178667","words":[null,{"g":"rid of, free of"},{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"two (numerical value…"}]},{"text":"Na ja, jetzt weißt du’s.","en":"Well, now you know.","words":[null,{"g":"yes"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"S"}]}]}